{"lesson_uid":"L0169","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":223,"chars":5312,"poly_positions":1275,"he_adjudicated":0,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9ja7n","idx":1,"text":"人體其實是一座精密的工廠，由206塊骨頭和數百條肌肉構成。清晨，你睜開眼、伸個懶腰，手臂一抬、一呼一吸，身體早已全員上工。你也許沒注意到，這短短幾秒，背後有超過二十條肌肉、十多塊骨頭、還有肺、肋間肌、橫膈膜、心臟一起配合協作──就像一支默契絕佳的工作團隊。每一次呼吸，數百萬個細胞正在同時衰亡與新生。所以，不但平凡的伸懶腰是一場無聲的奇蹟，連運動員在場上的精湛表現，都是這座工廠全力運轉的傑出成果。","n":199,"ssz":".....1............211.......................2..2.2.......................................21...............2.........2....................................1........2...................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9ja7n","idx":2,"text":"那麼，誰是這座工廠的老闆呢？你就是。如果你這個老闆只顧著提高生產，直到機器冒煙、員工疲倦、倉庫爆滿──最後整座工廠可能陷入罷工危機。但優秀的運動員，會是身體這座工廠的好老闆，他們隨時保養機器，也讓員工有良好訓練和休息──他們知道營養、水分、休息對身體的影響，也知道這些都和紮實嚴格訓練同等重要。","n":147,"ssz":"......................1..................................................................................1............1................1..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9ja7n","idx":3,"text":"比賽當下固然令人熱血沸騰，但中場休息的轉播有時也記錄下運動員的祕訣。當鏡頭掃過休息區，有時會看見選手在吃香蕉，或是啃著富含蛋白質的能量棒，有時則會看到一群人圍著大茶桶補水。對許多運動員來說，補充碳水化合物與蛋白質，並不是為了填飽肚子，而是為了幫肌肉修復。而當一般人都認為「口渴再喝水」時，對運動員來說，「口渴」就已經先輸人一截──那代表反應速度和注意力都已經下降。所以下次看轉播時，不妨留意鏡頭特寫──有人的帽子上留著白白的鹽漬，那是身體缺水的痕跡。而如果有一天你發現自己的尿液顏色像烏龍茶，那也是身體在提醒你：該補水了。","n":261,"ssz":"............................................................................................................1.1....1...1.........2...............................2.......1..1................................1......................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9ja7n","idx":4,"text":"那這一座工廠，只要有充足的能源、物料，就能保持穩定運轉了嗎？別忘了，這座工廠畢竟不是鐵打的，儘管是體能、技術高人一等的國手，都得「放假」。但是對很多人來說，「休息」、「放鬆」似乎和「耍廢」、「擺爛」畫上了等號。其實真正的休息，不是無所事事，運動員在訓練後安排伸展、泡冰水或早點入睡，都是在保養身體。眾多研究顯示，睡眠不足不僅會影響運動表現，還會增加受傷的風險。而賽後的收操則能幫助肌肉放鬆，減少痠痛發生。很多時候，場上的受傷看似突如其來，其實是長期累積疲勞的結果。所以對專業運動員來說，不只訓練需要照表操課，休息也不能馬虎。只有懂得照顧自己，才會有本錢挑戰極限。","n":281,"ssz":"..1.....................................1...............2......1..1......................1.......................1..............................................................................................................1...................................1....1..............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9ja7n","idx":5,"text":"而我想，沒有一個員工在全力以赴付出後，不希望收到老闆的真誠感謝。我們的身體默默支持、陪伴我們完成大大小小的事。失去健康後，即使再輕而易舉的事，也可能變得困難重重。也許，在每天洗澡或睡前、在每次竭盡全力的努力後，我們可以輕聲對身體說聲：「謝謝有你，辛苦了」。","n":128,"ssz":".......1...................................................................1..11.......................................1........"},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"wyvrp","idx":null,"text":"人體其實是一座精密的工廠，由206塊骨頭和數百條肌肉構成。清晨，你睜開眼、伸個懶腰，手臂一抬、一呼一吸，身體早已全員上工。你也許沒注意到，這短短幾秒，背後有超過二十條肌肉、十多塊骨頭、還有肺、肋間肌、橫膈膜、心臟一起配合協作──就像一支默契絕佳的工作團隊。每一次呼吸，數百萬個細胞正在同時衰亡與新生。所以，不但平凡的伸懶腰是一場無聲的奇蹟，連運動員在場上的精湛表現，都是這座工廠全力運轉的傑出成果。那麼，誰是這座工廠的老闆呢？你就是。如果你這個老闆只顧著提高生產，直到機器冒煙、員工疲倦、倉庫爆滿──最後整座工廠可能陷入罷工危機。但優秀的運動員，會是身體這座工廠的好老闆，他們隨時保養機器，也讓員工有良好訓練和休息──他們知道營養、水分、休息對身體的影響，也知道這些都和紮實嚴格訓練同等重要。","n":346,"ssz":".....1............211.......................2..2.2.......................................21...............2.........2....................................1........2..........................................................1..................................................................................1............1................1..........."},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"體-L3","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"體育生","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:grade","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格教育","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體，謝謝你","n":6,"ssz":"....1."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"議論文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格力──身體覺察與照護","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章將帶我們一起認識我們身體的奧妙。身體就像一座精密的工廠，由骨骼和肌肉組成，每天都在默默地運作，完成各種任務。文章會探討我們如何成為這座身體工廠的好老闆，透過均衡的營養、充足的水分和適當的休息來保養它。同時，也會介紹運動員如何透過飲食和補水來維持最佳狀態，以及休息對於身體恢復和預防受傷的重要性。最後，文章鼓勵我們用心感受身體的付出，並對它表達感謝。","n":178,"ssz":"........2...............1..........1...........1............................................11.1........................1....................1...................................."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體覺察與照護","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"突如其來","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"發生得很突然，讓人來不及反應。","n":15,"ssz":"..1..........1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"固然","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雖然。","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祕訣","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能讓事情成功的小方法或關鍵技巧。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紮實","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"穩固、結實，此形容內容充實。","n":14,"ssz":"...1.........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"輸人一截","n":4,"ssz":"..2."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比別人差一些，落後對方。","n":12,"ssz":"....2......."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"照表操課","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依照固定的計畫或流程來做事情。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不妨","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表示可以試試看，用來表達建議。","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"碳水化合物","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一種主要的營養素，像是飯、麵、糖類等，是提供能量的來源。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本錢","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能用來達成目標的資源、條件或優勢。","n":17,"ssz":".......2........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"精湛","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"技藝高明、熟練。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鹽漬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"流汗後留下的白色汗漬。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[11].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"馬虎","n":2,"ssz":".1"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[11].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"做事隨便、不仔細，常出錯。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"手機(　)為生活帶來許多便利，也可能造成專注力下降的問題。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他(　)的演技，讓台下的觀眾目不轉睛，也因此獲得許多好評。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"考試前夕，(　)提早就寢，讓大腦消化和運用知識更有效率。","n":28,"ssz":"..................1........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他做事(　)，又常推卸責任，讓同組同學都感到氣憤不已。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「健康」是探索世界的(　)，唯有顧好身體，才能走得更遠。","n":28,"ssz":"........................1..."},{"section":"served:fil